    "content": {
      "type": "surface",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "root",
        "kind": "page",
        "name": "Connect ChatGPT to ShowAI",
        "widthMode": "standard"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "widget",
          "attrs": {
            "kind": "custom",
            "data": {
              "componentId": "doc-hero",
              "version": "1.0.0",
              "props": {
                "title": "Connect ChatGPT to ShowAI",
                "art": "agent",
                "lead": "ChatGPT web sends requests from the cloud. Connect it to ShowAI on your own computer or to a hosted MCP endpoint supplied by an administrator. Both require a public HTTPS endpoint reachable by ChatGPT.",
                "actions": [
                  {
                    "label": "Universal plugin connection guide",
                    "href": "https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/connect-mcp",
                    "primary": true
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Download the universal plugin ZIP",
                    "href": "https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/downloads/showai-universal.zip"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "integrity": "sha256-6aa1b6a2a0e9657120847e829da416cc95c91acb8b96f04da0960c1b732e5e84"
            },
            "id": "node-b7460b99"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-b44606e0",
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Choose where pages are saved"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "widget",
          "attrs": {
            "kind": "custom",
            "data": {
              "componentId": "doc-compare",
              "version": "1.0.0",
              "props": {
                "columns": [
                  {
                    "id": "url",
                    "label": "Where to get the URL",
                    "tone": "brand"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "storage",
                    "label": "Projects and authorization",
                    "tone": "teal"
                  }
                ],
                "rows": [
                  {
                    "label": "Your own ShowAI desktop app",
                    "values": {
                      "url": "打开「设置 → 远程 MCP → 公网入口」，开启并检查地址。",
                      "storage": "Projects live in the library on that computer. You approve the connection in the desktop app."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Team-hosted MCP",
                    "values": {
                      "url": "使用运营方提供的完整 /mcp 地址。受控注册的服务可能需要注册密钥或共享项目邀请。",
                      "storage": "Use the account and projects granted by that service. Check synchronization separately when using cloud sync."
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "integrity": "sha256-6450bf2fc82c6750eddbcc964d4133ab036484132eb122fee1599efa18c7a12c"
            },
            "id": "node-chatgpt-storage"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-b8460d2c",
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Add the server manually in ChatGPT"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "widget",
          "attrs": {
            "kind": "custom",
            "data": {
              "componentId": "doc-steps",
              "version": "1.0.0",
              "props": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "title": "Copy the actual URL",
                    "body": "Copy the public HTTPS URL shown for the endpoint, including /mcp. If a temporary hostname changes, update the existing connection."
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Add a custom MCP server",
                    "body": "Open ChatGPT Plugins and choose + → Add custom MCP server → Server URL. Enter the URL, choose OAuth with dynamic client registration (DCR), then create the entry and connect."
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Review the authorization request",
                    "body": "For your desktop app, check the client, connection number and project permissions before approving. For a hosted service, sign in on the operator’s authorization page and choose a scope."
                  }
                ]
              },
              "integrity": "sha256-0c4f6546ba7ab683adfaa028a3ad70cea166479204a4f1f462ef27eb314ff07b"
            },
            "id": "node-22420cb6"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-27421495"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Open ChatGPT Plugins",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://chatgpt.com/plugins"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-2542116f",
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Install Skills and verify access"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-23420e49"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You can install the universal ZIP before adding MCP. To explicitly associate the six Skills with an existing ChatGPT connection, choose ChatGPT in the public endpoint in ShowAI, use Export ChatGPT plugin, enter the registered connection’s plugin page link and import the resulting ShowAI Personal package in ChatGPT."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-21420b23"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Call projects_list on the same ChatGPT connection. Once it returns a list, select a writable project to save work. The save receipt identifies the original page; the reader provides the preview in chat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-9d3efcc0",
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When an existing connection stops working"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-9e3efe53"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If sign-in or authorization has expired, reconnect the original entry. If the desktop approval request does not arrive, check that ShowAI is online, the public route is enabled and the Server URL is current. Refresh stale tools in the host, then verify on the same connection."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "node-a83f0e11"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Universal plugin connection guide",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/connect-mcp"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " · "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use with an Agent",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
